(7136295, 1093586, 144365, '<td valign="top">I had the exact same idea, except the weather here was too cold to spend time outside to get it right for the minimal editing ruleset. <br/> <br/>This is a good effort and the only thing I would have done differently is have the people "sell" the pose like they really were casting spells or beams from their hands.</td>', 'I had the exact same idea, except the weather here was too cold to spend time outside to get it right for the minimal editing ruleset.  This is a good effort and the only thing I would have done differently is have the people "sell" the pose like they really were casting spells or beams from their hands.', '2013-11-29 09:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7136297, 1093288, 144365, '<td valign="top">Had to stare at this for a while. Didn''t think Hammer would wear those colours at an international event, but the helmet gives away it''s an American. I can see two Canadians to her left. <br/> <br/>I was hoping Laura Brown was going to win, but I''m slightly biased in that regard. This is my top pick in this challenge.</td>', 'Had to stare at this for a while. Didn''t think Hammer would wear those colours at an international event, but the helmet gives away it''s an American. I can see two Canadians to her left.  I was hoping Laura Brown was going to win, but I''m slightly biased in that regard. This is my top pick in this challenge.', '2013-11-29 09:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7136316, 1093297, 49954, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, but IMO the long exposure does blur the water, but the moving water is such an insignificant piece of the overall image...</td>', 'Love the idea, but IMO the long exposure does blur the water, but the moving water is such an insignificant piece of the overall image...', '2013-11-29 11:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
