(7136821, 1093594, 30364, '<td valign="top">A gourd, an onion, a bag of mushrooms.  I thought H was the weeper, of was it the whiner?  But it looks like he''s the pizza maker.<br/>I might have him confused with some other bloke, however. No matter: it''s all Greek to me anyway.<br/> <br/>It romps easily into my top three, because it''s not predictable and it is at least intriguing.  Interesting. I think the two shiny things are important, but have no clue what or why.  No need to explain; I like this state of anxiety.<br/> <br/>Thank you.</td>', 'A gourd, an onion, a bag of mushrooms.  I thought H was the weeper, of was it the whiner?  But it looks like he''s the pizza maker.I might have him confused with some other bloke, however. No matter: it''s all Greek to me anyway. It romps easily into my top three, because it''s not predictable and it is at least intriguing.  Interesting. I think the two shiny things are important, but have no clue what or why.  No need to explain; I like this state of anxiety. Thank you.', '2013-12-01 05:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7136822, 1093564, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is  strangely lovely.  The long exposure transforms it into something else.  Music.  Or a code of some kind.  Anyway, it would have been boring, and now it''s not. In my top three. Thank you.</td>', 'This is  strangely lovely.  The long exposure transforms it into something else.  Music.  Or a code of some kind.  Anyway, it would have been boring, and now it''s not. In my top three. Thank you.', '2013-12-01 05:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
