(7139103, 1093272, 144365, '<td valign="top">Going to start commenting on all entries where I voted a one. <br/> <br/>The challenge was <i>use a longer than normal exposure to create the impact of your image.</i> This may have been a thirty second exposure, but could have been achieved using a flash. There is nothing about this image that makes me think long exposure and thus creates no meaningful impact because of that fact.</td>', 'Going to start commenting on all entries where I voted a one.  The challenge was use a longer than normal exposure to create the impact of your image. This may have been a thirty second exposure, but could have been achieved using a flash. There is nothing about this image that makes me think long exposure and thus creates no meaningful impact because of that fact.', '2013-12-05 09:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
